  "zh": "# 今日AI与科技领域多项突破引发全球关注\n## AI 与科技\n- **Sonnet 5.5 发布**：Anthropic 推出新版 Claude 模型，性能提升显著，引发业界关注。\n- **World Labs 加入 AMD**：World Labs 宣布将加入 AMD，强化 AI 硬件生态，预计加速芯片创新。\n## 国内政策与社会\n- **北京大学禁止景区开会**：北大新规禁止在景区开会，旨在减少形式主义，引发高校关注。\n- **骗子骗补贴超1亿元**：跨省诈骗补贴案曝光，涉及金额巨大，凸显监管漏洞。\n## 国际视野\n- **特朗普评价中美会晤**：特朗普称中美元首会晤 “Amazing”，引发外交舆论热议。\n- **中国制图还原火星**：中国科研团队利用遥感数据还原火星古代环境，为探测提供新视角。",
  "en": "# Today’s AI breakthroughs and policy moves spark global attention\n## AI & Tech\n- **Sonnet 5.5 release**：Anthropic’s new Claude model shows notable performance gains, stirring industry interest.\n- **World Labs joins AMD**：World Labs will integrate with AMD to boost AI hardware ecosystem, expected to accelerate chip innovation.\n## Domestic Policy\n- **Bans campus meetings at scenic spots**：Peking University prohibits off‑campus meetings at scenic sites to curb formalism, drawing campus debate.\n- **Fraudsters scam over $100M in subsidies**：A cross‑province subsidy fraud case exceeds 100 million yuan, exposing regulatory gaps.\n## International\n- **Trump praises US-China summit as amazing**：Trump lauded the recent US‑China leaders’ meeting as “Amazing,” sparking diplomatic chatter.\n- **China maps Mars’ past and present**：Chinese researchers used remote sensing to reconstruct Mars’ ancient environment, offering fresh insight for exploration."
